# The API base. LEAVE IT BLANK (the default since feat/lan-web): the client
# then uses the page's own host on port 5000 — http://localhost:3000 talks to
# http://localhost:5000/api, and a phone's Chrome at http://<laptop IP>:3000
# talks to http://<laptop IP>:5000/api (src/api/apiBase.js). Set it only to
# point the web at an API somewhere else; a set value wins, so a
# localhost value here would send a phone's Chrome to the PHONE's localhost.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
